            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp class=\u0022govuk-body\u0022\u003EThis text and this application is using\u0026nbsp;\u003Ca href=\u0022https://design-system.service.gov.uk/styles/typography/\u0022 class=\u0022govuk-link\u0022\u003EGOV.UK Design System typography\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022govuk-body\u0022\u003ETypical pages use standard\u0026nbsp;\u003Ca href=\u0022/{localLink:8e4e33e6-b5fa-40a2-86cd-7706fcea04ac}\u0022 type=\u0022document\u0022 class=\u0022govuk-link\u0022\u003Etypography\u003C/a\u003E. Where pages are expected to have deeply nested section hierarchies, we start heading sizes at\u0026nbsp;\u003Cem\u003Egovuk-heading-xl\u003C/em\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022govuk-body\u0022\u003EThe heading above demonstrates the type scale at Heading 1, using\u0026nbsp;\u003Cem\u003Egovuk-heading-xl\u003C/em\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch2 class=\u0022govuk-heading-l\u0022\u003EHeading 2\u003C/h2\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022govuk-body\u0022\u003EOn a page with deeply nested sections this is the type scale for headings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3 class=\u0022govuk-heading-m\u0022\u003EHeading 3\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022govuk-body\u0022\u003EOn a page with deeply nested sections this is the type scale for headings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch4 class=\u0022govuk-heading-s\u0022\u003EHeading 4\u003C/h4\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022govuk-body\u0022\u003EOn a page with deeply nested sections this is the type scale for headings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch5 class=\u0022govuk-heading-s\u0022\u003EHeading 5\u003C/h5\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022govuk-body\u0022\u003EOn a page with deeply nested sections this is the type scale for headings.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch6 class=\u0022govuk-heading-s\u0022\u003EHeading 6\u003C/h6\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022govuk-body\u0022\u003EOn a page with deeply nested sections this is the type scale for headings.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
